# Applies to a deployment made from this directory. Two projects are built
# out of this repository:
#
#   absa-sentiment   Root Directory frontend/   the UI
#   absa-api         Root Directory .           the API (see deploy/vercel/)
#
# so this list can only hold what *neither* of them needs. backend/ and
# training/ were listed here while the frontend was the only project. They
# cannot be now: the API's image is built from them, and excluding them makes
# the Docker build fail on `COPY backend/ backend/` with nothing uploaded to
# copy.
#
# Everything below is gitignored too, so a Git deployment never sees it. The
# list is for `vercel deploy` from a working tree, which does not reliably
# apply .gitignore to the upload and would otherwise try to send the ~3.7GB
# this directory holds: five ~430MB checkpoints under training/artifacts and
# the torch libraries in .venv. Either one trips the 100MB-per-file limit.
#
# Excluding training/artifacts does not starve the API of its weights: the
# image pulls them from the Hub at build time
# (deploy/vercel/fetch_artifact.py), after the upload this list filters.
.venv
training/artifacts
training/data
.pytest_cache
*.pdf
VIDEO_SCRIPT*.md

# Build outputs and dependencies are produced on Vercel, not shipped to it.
node_modules
dist
